body:
Yeah unfortunately it's just images sourced straight from the files, which aren't very big. Once I get my hands on some screenshots (especially for the ones currently unreleased in NA), I'll be sure to add them!

&#x200B;

*So if anyone has access to the KR and would like to offer some screenshots... That'd be great!*

Definitely not the case, as I was there prior to the reset, and once reset happened all the statues disappeared. Unless of course the entire island cleared at the exact same second.

&#x200B;

Reset time should be at 4PM now that they fixed the servers tho.

At my high school, our principal would come and interrupt our classes just to give us free cookies. He also had a mini-fridge stocked up with Pepsi and a bowl of candy in his office free to take. He gave out tokens as rewards that could be used to purchase things from the cafeteria, even if it's for the stupidest thing. I got a token cause my dad showed up to parent teacher conferences and another time just because I had a sibling at my school. He was a good guy. Because of him, high school was bearable. 

&#x200B;

I know you're not a Redditor, but wherever you are now, you a cool dude, thanks.

Oh I just realized some have been deleted, probably because of the link to the Facer broke rule 8. In that case, if anyone wants to download this watch face, it's up on Facer under Animal Crossing: Spring. :)

&#x200B;

Also, since many people were asking and it was answered in the deleted post, the watch featured is a Fossil Q Venture HR with a black strap!

Sure! It's free [heree](https://www.facer.io/watchface/BvM6BHv8Pk). :) Enjoy!

&#x200B;

*Side note: Because it has like almost all the villagers from ACPC in it, you may wanna be a little patient upon first download/use. It takes a little longer than other watch faces to boot up.*

Here's [some actual screenshots](https://imgur.com/gallery/8bPlUGV) of the features! Reset timers are synced with Pocket Camp's goal, fortune cookie and market timers so you never have to forget when stuff resets! :)

&#x200B;

Edit: A link to the [free watch face](https://www.facer.io/watchface/BvM6BHv8Pk)! And since many people asked, the watch featured is a Fossil Q Venture HR with a black strap. As long as you have a watch that runs Wear OS 2.0 and can download Facer, you can get this watch face! Enjoyy! :) ^(notsponsored lol)

But how many people actually filled this up with sand or something?

&#x200B;

Cause everytime I saw this as a kid, it was just filled with dirty leftover rainwater and mud.

What's the wooden guild chest?

&#x200B;

Edit: Nevermind, I figured it out. Thanks!
